        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Valley_City%2C_Ohio",
      "category": "culture",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 2021 the festival drew over 4,000 attendees and 750 frogs, a record crowd.",
